        {
          "path": "_m/w/4/r/q/golden-buddha-statue-wp/golden-buddha-at-wat-traimit-6.jpg",
          "filename": "Golden Buddha at Wat Traimit (6491905489).jpg",
          "caption": "The world's largest gold Buddha image at 3m tall and 5.5 tonnes.\n\nApparently its golden nature was only rediscovered 50 years ago after centuries of disguise. It has been hidden by a plaster casing centuries ago to disguise it from invading Burmese armies, a common tactic in the day. Like several others (including the famous Emerald Buddha also in Bangkok), its true nature was eventually forgotten for centuries until it was rediscovered by accident when it was dropped from a crane trying to move it.",
          "alt": "The world's largest gold Buddha image at 3m tall and 5.5 tonnes.\n\nApparently its golden nature was only rediscovered 50 years ago after centuries of disguise. It has been hidden by a plaster casing centuries ago to disguise it from invading Burmese armies, a common tactic in the day. Like several others (including the famous Emerald Buddha also in Bangkok), its true nature was eventually forgotten for centuries until it was rediscovered by accident when it was dropped from a crane trying to move it.",
          "width": 2376,
          "height": 1584,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
